{Provable}_{\\mathcal P}:\\mathrm{Seq}_S\\to\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathcal P}(s)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal T\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\land\\ell_{\\mathcal T}(r_{\\mathcal T})=s\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathcal P}(s)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal T\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\land\\ell_{\\mathcal T}(r_{\\mathcal T})=s\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\\vdash(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathcal P}(\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P\\vdash(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathcal P}(\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地的双边证明树接口。单边半形式 D 关系有独立定义，不能只换 Γ 的排版就视为同一签名。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"68c5bcff4a164cd8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"68c5bcff4a164cd8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$ 为 [[18-df-proof-tree]] 的规则实例集，$s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S$；$r_{\\mathcal T},\\ell_{\\mathcal T}$ 为证明树五元组投影。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mat